window.handboundCards = [{"number":"1101001","name":"Black Ant","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Ant","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Plain to the eye, this small creature hides determination within its shiny black shell.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1101002","name":"Velvet Ant","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Velvet Ant","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Delicate in appearance, deadly in reality. One misstep, and this little ant proves that even the smallest can pack a punch.","atk":"2","def":"0"},{"number":"1101003","name":"Common Roach","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Common Roach","ability":"N/A","flavor":"An annoying roach that is oddly difficult to kill... for a bug.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"1101004","name":"Goliathus Beetle","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Goliathus Beetle","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Large for a bug, the size of ones hand, the goliathus beetle demands respect.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1101005","name":"Insi Bug","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Insi Bug","ability":"N/A","flavor":"This tiny bug doesn\u0027t do much... of anything... it\u0027s pretty insignificant.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1101006","name":"Aphid Egg Clutch","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Aphid Egg Clutch","ability":"This creature cannot attack. Once per turn: Create a 0/0 Bug-type creature token on your field.","flavor":"Small, fragile, and easily overlooked, the clutch hums with potential. One by one, tiny aphids wriggle free, ready to join the swarm.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1101007","name":"Family Picnic","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Family Picnic","ability":"This creature cannot attack. End of your turn: You may create one 0/0 Bug-type creature token and one 1/1 Bug-type creature token on your field. Start of your turn: If there are 6 or more Bug-type creatures on your field destroy this creature.","flavor":"What began as a quiet afternoon together quickly became a feast for far more mouths than anyone expected.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1101008","name":"Ug Beetles","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Ug Beetles","ability":"On play: Create two 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"These ugly beetles often run in threes. Don\u0027t be fooled by their ugly appearance, they can put up bit of a fight.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1101009","name":"Brood Carrier","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Brood Carrier","ability":"This creature is attacked and destroyed: Create one 0/0 Bug-type creature token.","flavor":"Its body may fall, but the brood it carried will continue the colony\u0027s work.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1101010","name":"Pheromone Scout","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Pheromone Scout","ability":"During your Attack Phase: Bug-type creature tokens gain +1 ATK.","flavor":"With every step, it leaves a trail that turns the colony\u0027s wandering into a coordinated hunt.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1101011","name":"Brood Tender","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Brood Tender","ability":"End of your turn: If there are no Bug-type creature tokens on your field you may create one 0/0 Bug-type creature token on your field.","flavor":"As long as one remains to tend the nest, the brood will never be gone for long.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1101012","name":"Ver Beetle","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Ver Beetle","ability":"During your Attack Phase: You may target and destroy this creature. If you do, give one Bug-type creature on your field +1 ATK.","flavor":"A small juicy green beetle. Other bugs love to eat it as it is packed with nutrients.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1101013","name":"Larva Feeder","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Larva Feeder","ability":"As an additional cost to play this card: Target and destroy one Bug-type creature token on your field.","flavor":"It doesn\u0027t hunt the strong or the swift, only the helpless. Fresh larvae are its favorite, soft and easy prey.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1201001","name":"Bullet Ant","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Bullet Ant","ability":"N/A","flavor":"A large ant with even larger mandibles, its sting strikes like a bullet. Those who underestimate it learn the pain too late.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1201002","name":"Black Beetle","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Beetle","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Plain in color but tough in spirit, the Black Beetle trudges forward through dirt and debris. Strength lies not in beauty, but in endurance.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1201003","name":"Green Moof Slug","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Green Moof Slug","ability":"","flavor":"This odd green slug was discovered by a 12 year old kid named Moof. He promptly named it after himself.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1201004","name":"Compost Bubble Slug","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Compost Bubble Slug","ability":"Non-token Bug-type creature is destroyed: Create one 0/0 Bug-type creature token on your field. End of your Attack Phase: If no non-token Bug-type creatures have been destroyed since the start of your previous Attack Phase, destroy this creature.","flavor":"This tiny odd looking slug eats the remains of decomposing bugs. They will reproduce until they can\u0027t find any food, then they quickly die off.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1201005","name":"Black Ant Queen","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Ant Queen","ability":"Once per turn: You may destroy a creature token on your field. If you do, create two 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"While the workers march and the soldiers fight, she remains below devouring without rest. Turning fuel into another generation of soldiers.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1201006","name":"Nurse Ant","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Nurse Ant","ability":"You create a Bug-type creature token: It gains +1 ATK and +1 DEF.","flavor":"The colony\u0027s best warriors are not always born strong; some are raised to be that way.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1201007","name":"Black Ant Hill","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Ant Hill","ability":"This creature cannot attack. Once per turn: You may create one 1/1 Bug-type creature token.","flavor":"The hill hums with endless activity, a living fortress of tunnels and legs. From its depths, tiny workers emerge, always ready.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"1201008","name":"Pumpkin Beetle","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Pumpkin Beetle","ability":"You may target and destroy this creature. If you do, the next Bug-type creature you play this turn costs one less.","flavor":"A large and fat orange beetle. They are often found eating farmers\u0027 pumpkins, melons and squash.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1301001","name":"Giant Locust","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Giant Locust","ability":"N/A","flavor":"No one knows where it came from, only that it devours everything in sight. Its size alone is enough to turn farmers pale.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1301002","name":"Brood Mother","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Brood Mother","ability":"End of your turn: You may create two 0/0 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"A large hairy insect with a giant abdomen. It will produce more and more bugs until it creates a personal army.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1301003","name":"Periwinkle Roly Poly","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Periwinkle Roly Poly","ability":"This creature declares an attack: Create two 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field that attack the same target. Destroy these tokens at the end of your turn.","flavor":"These colorful roly polys often hunt in trios. Their rare coloring makes them sought after as pets for those who like bugs.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1301004","name":"Blue Queen Roach","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Blue Queen Roach","ability":"If there are no other Bug-type creatures on your field on play: You may create three 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"These roaches have a bright blue shell and love to order around other bugs. If they are alone they will release their young to do their bidding.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1301005","name":"Rosette Mite Mother","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Rosette Mite Mother","ability":"On play: Create four 0/0 Bug-type creature tokens on your field and two 0/0 Bug-type creature tokens on your opponent’s field.","flavor":"The rosette mite mother understands the chaos of motherhood all too well... Some of her young are so unruly they will even turn on her.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1401001","name":"Black Ant Swarm","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Ant Swarm","ability":"On play: Create four 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"Legions of black ants swarm with incredible numbers. Each soldier may be tiny, but together they are a force no one can ignore.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1401002","name":"Carrion Beacon","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Carrion Beacon","ability":"End of your turn: Create one 1/1 and two 0/0 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"The massive critter died long ago. Its rotting husk releases a scent no bug can ignore, calling countless bodies to gather and feed.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1401003","name":"Morix Warrior","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Morix Warrior","ability":"On play: Target and destroy all token creatures on your field. X and Y are each equal to the number of Bug-type creature tokens destroyed this way.","flavor":"The swarm exists for one purpose: to feed the rise of their chosen champion. From countless small sacrifices, a perfect killing machine is born.","atk":"X","def":"Y"},{"number":"1501001","name":"Bug Lord Multimere","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Bug Lord Multimere","ability":"One or more Bug-type creature tokens are going to be created, other than by \"Bug Lord Multimere\": Double the amount of tokens to be created.","flavor":"No hive is too small, no bug too weak. With Multimere in command, even the smallest infestation becomes a consuming swarm.","atk":"1","def":"3"},{"number":"1501002","name":"Scyther Bug Luminaris","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Scyther Bug Luminaris","ability":"X is always equal to the number of pure Bug-type creatures on the field. This creature destroys a non-Bug-type creature by battle: Create one 1/1 Bug-type creature token on your field.","flavor":"Each blade shines with the will of the swarm. Another growing with each new spawn. It carves through its enemies, consuming to spawn more.","atk":"X","def":"3"},{"number":"2101001","name":"Bit O\u0027 Honey","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Bit O\u0027 Honey","ability":"Create one 0/0 Bug type creature token on your field.","flavor":"A drop of sweetness is all it takes to draw out a hungry critter."},{"number":"2101002","name":"Worker Overload","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Worker Overload","ability":"For the rest of your turn if you were to create a 1/1 Bug type creature token on your field, you may create two 0/0 Bug type creature tokens on your field instead.","flavor":"The colony abandons warfare in favor of endless construction and growth. The swarm floods with tireless workers."},{"number":"2101003","name":"Colony Fortification","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Colony Fortification","ability":"Target all Bug-type creature tokens on your field, they gain +1 DEF until the start of your turn.","flavor":"Thousands of tiny bodies shift into place, turning the colony into a defensive bulwark."},{"number":"2101004","name":"Enhanced Mandibles","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Enhanced Mandibles","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Target a Bug-type creature on your field, it gains +1 ATK until the end of your turn.","flavor":"Larger, sharper, and packing more punch, these mandibles are to be feared."},{"number":"2101005","name":"Sudden Swarmguard","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Sudden Swarmguard","ability":"AW End of your Draw Phase: Create two 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field, then end your turn.","flavor":"The hive chooses protection over progress. New defenders arrive in an instant, but the colony pauses, bracing for what comes next."},{"number":"2101006","name":"Thorax Explosive","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Thorax Explosive","ability":"AW Bug-type creature token on your field is targeted for an attack by one other creature: Target and destroy all creatures in the battle and all token creatures on your field.","flavor":"No one notices the tension in its segmented body until it’s far too late. When it bursts, it takes everything nearby with it."},{"number":"2101007","name":"One For The Hive","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"One For The Hive","ability":"AW Opponent declares an attack targeting a creature on your field: Change the attack target to a Bug-type creature token on your field.","flavor":"When danger comes, the swarm answers first, eager to shield what must survive. The colony knows that some lives are meant to be spent."},{"number":"2101008","name":"Emergency Hatching","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Emergency Hatching","ability":"AW Start of your turn: Skip your Draw Phase and create three 0/0 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"In desperation, the colony trades tomorrow’s strength for today’s survival. The brood emerges early, small and shaking, but ready to fight."},{"number":"2101009","name":"Hive Protection Order","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hive Protection Order","ability":"AW As an additional cost to play this card: Target and destroy two Bug-type creature tokens on your field. Negate target spell.","flavor":"To save the hive, nothing is too costly and no life too small. The swarm answers danger with direct and honorable action."},{"number":"2201001","name":"Ball of Aphids","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Ball of Aphids","ability":"Create three 0/0 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"The wobbling ball hits the ground with a wet splat and bursts into dozens of confused aphids, most not surviving the fall."},{"number":"2201002","name":"Critter Wake","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Critter Wake","ability":"As an additional cost to play this card: Target and destroy one non-token creature on your field. If you do, create four 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"The moment its body hit the ground, the soil stirred. Ants poured from every crevice, drawn by instinct and the promise of a meal."},{"number":"2201003","name":"Hive Efficiency","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hive Efficiency","ability":"As an additional cost to play this card: Target and destroy three Bug-type creature tokens on your field. Reduce all Bug-type cards costs by -1 until the end of your turn. (Costs cannot be reduced below 0.)","flavor":"Every worker moves in perfect rhythm, each action feeding the next. Today the colony moves with a single mind."},{"number":"2201004","name":"Fuel the Swarm","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Fuel the Swarm","ability":"AW As an additional cost to play this card: Target and destroy two Bug-type creature tokens on your field. End of your Attack Phase: Target one Bug-type creature on your field. That creature declares an attack.","flavor":"The fallen are trampled beneath a tide of fury, their sacrifice buying one more brutal charge. In the swarm, even death can be weaponized."},{"number":"2201005","name":"Crawling Remains","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Crawling Remains","ability":"AW Creature on your field is destroyed by battle: Create a 0/0 Bug-type creature token on your field for each ATK that creature had.","flavor":"As the body falls apart, countless smaller forms crawl free to continue the fight."},{"number":"2201006","name":"Brood Directive","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Brood Directive","ability":"As an additional cost to play this card: Target and destroy one Bug-type creature token on your field. Target one Bug-type creature on your field. Activate one of its \"once per turn,\" \"start of turn,\" or \"end of turn\" abilities.","flavor":"The queen’s will ripples through the colony, demanding immediate response. A single life is a small price for perfect coordination."},{"number":"2301001","name":"Twin Hatching","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Twin Hatching","ability":"Create two 1/1 Bug-type creature tokens on your field.","flavor":"Twice the cracks, twice the crawling chaos. The hive wastes no time turning new life into new soldiers."},{"number":"2301002","name":"Many for the Mighty","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Many for the Mighty","ability":"Target and destroy X Bug-type creature tokens on your field. If you do, target and destroy one creature on your opponent’s field with cost equal to X-1.","flavor":"Tiny bodies swarm and overwhelm, dragging down something far greater than themselves."},{"number":"2301003","name":"Strength Of The Many","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Strength Of The Many","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Bug-type creature tokens on your field gain +1 ATK until the end of your turn.","flavor":"The colony moves in unison, even the smallest worker strikes with great force. Numbers become power, and power becomes victory."},{"number":"2401001","name":"One of Thousands","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Bug"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"One of Thousands","ability":"Target a Bug-type creature on your field. Target creature cannot be the target of an attack unless it is the only creature on your field.","flavor":"It scurries among countless identical bodies, indistinguishable from the rest. Once you think you\u0027ve found it, it’s already lost again."},{"number":"1102001","name":"Escaped Pig","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Escaped Pig","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Raised at a farm for slaughter, this pig managed to escape into the nearby woods. It spends its time foraging and trying to escape predators.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1102002","name":"Long Tailed Weasel","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Long Tailed Weasel","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Its body is built for speed, its instincts for the hunt. By the time you see it move, the Long Tailed Weasel has already hit its mark.","atk":"2","def":"0"},{"number":"1102003","name":"Mud Turtle","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mud Turtle","ability":"N/A","flavor":"It coats its shell in layers of hardened mud. Attacking it is easy, getting through is not.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"1102004","name":"White Tailed Deer","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"White Tailed Deer","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Its white tail flicks as it bounds through the woods. Graceful and ever-watchful, it moves through the forest with quiet confidence.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1102005","name":"Wild Boar","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Wild Boar","ability":"N/A","flavor":"A creature ruled by instinct, hunger, and aggression. If you are not careful, a fight with this boar could see you on the end of its tusks.","atk":"3","def":"1"},{"number":"1102006","name":"Ribbed Horn Ram","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Ribbed Horn Ram","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Born in the high peaks of the Thorn Crest mountains this rams horns were hardened through countless battles and harsh conditions.","atk":"1","def":"3"},{"number":"1102007","name":"Black Bear","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Bear","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Strong, resilient, and always hungry. It will eat anything from berries to your arm. Remember they can climb trees.","atk":"3","def":"4"},{"number":"1102008","name":"King Of The Savanna","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"King Of The Savanna","ability":"N/A","flavor":"The dry savanna wind carries the Kings roar across his domain. Those who misstep will be realigned by the tooth and claw of the King.","atk":"4","def":"3"},{"number":"1102009","name":"Timberjaw Tortoise","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Timberjaw Tortoise","ability":"N/A","flavor":"This old, slow but massive tortoise has jaws powerful enough to shatter tree trunks. Used by loggers, Timberjaws are truly forces of nature.","atk":"2","def":"5"},{"number":"1102010","name":"Bloodrage Wolverine","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Bloodrage Wolverine","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Overcome with bloodlust, a Bloodrage Wolverine is the worst creature to encounter. It attacks without any thought for its own well-being.","atk":"5","def":"2"},{"number":"1102011","name":"Newborn Mouse","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Newborn Mouse","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Blind, hairless, and helpless, it knows little of the world and its dangers.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1102012","name":"Lone Hedgehog","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Lone Hedgehog","ability":"While this is the only creature on your field: This creature gains +1 ATK and +1 DEF.","flavor":"It thrives in isolation, relying on no one but itself. In that quiet, its strength shows.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1102013","name":"Razorbound Wolf","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Razorbound Wolf","ability":"Start of your turn: This creature loses -1 ATK and -1 DEF.","flavor":"Chains dig into its flesh, but it pulls harder still. It would rather bleed than remain bound.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1202001","name":"Red Fox","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Red Fox","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Swift and cunning, it weaves through the underbrush looking for a meal.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1202002","name":"Yellow Shell Armadillo","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Yellow Shell Armadillo","ability":"N/A","flavor":"There is a tale about a beast with a shell made out of gold. Unfortunately people hunted this creature to near extinction, thinking it was the legend.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1202003","name":"Brown Hare","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Brown Hare","ability":"N/A","flavor":"A simple brown rabbit searching for a snack along the forest floor. There are plenty of them but they can be hard to spot and hard to catch.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1202004","name":"Grey Wolf","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Grey Wolf","ability":"N/A","flavor":"It moves through the forest with silent confidence, every step measured. When it strikes, it does so with the precision of a seasoned hunter.","atk":"4","def":"2"},{"number":"1202005","name":"Northern Moose","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Northern Moose","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Massive and unbothered, it moves through the cold wilderness without worry. It knows that few would dare to challenge its might.","atk":"3","def":"3"},{"number":"1202006","name":"Horn Turtle","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Horn Turtle","ability":"This creature is attacked: Switch its ATK and DEF until the battle resolves.","flavor":"With its mighty curved horn, it strikes with precision, impaling those who stand in its way. When threatened, it retreats into its shell.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1202007","name":"Two Headed Wolf","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Two Headed Wolf","ability":"This creature can declare an attack twice each Attack Phase.","flavor":"With two fierce heads, this wolf prowls the shadows, its fur glistening like moonlight. Each head brings its own cunning and its own fangs.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1202008","name":"Mortal Wound Wolf","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mortal Wound Wolf","ability":"End of your Attack Phase: Destroy this creature.","flavor":"Its white fur is stained red from its own blood, and that of its foes. Even on the brink of death, it refuses to give in, fighting until its final moment.","atk":"2","def":"0"},{"number":"1302001","name":"Majestic Stag","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Majestic Stag","ability":"N/A","flavor":"This majestic stag is the stuff of legend. Hunters swap tales in dim taverns, swearing they’ve seen it, yet none have claimed the beautiful beast.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1302002","name":"Oinkabelle","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Oinkabelle","ability":"N/A","flavor":"With a silky red bow and a snout that nudges for treats, Oinkabelle has never known a day of hardship. She’s too precious for anything but love.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1302003","name":"Young Wolf Beast","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Young Wolf Beast","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Still young, yet already far too large and far too fierce. Whatever blood runs through it, it is not entirely wolf.","atk":"4","def":"3"},{"number":"1302004","name":"Twin Shield Hog Hork","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Twin Shield Hog Hork","ability":"This creature attacks: Switch its ATK and DEF until the battle resolves.","flavor":"Hork fights with brute strength and stubborn defense, swinging his axe one moment and hiding behind twin shields the next.","atk":"2","def":"4"},{"number":"1302005","name":"Vampiric Feline","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Vampiric Feline","ability":"This creature destroys a creature as a result of battle: This creature gains ATK equal to that creature’s ATK.","flavor":"It hunts with silent grace, striking only when the kill is certain. With every fallen prey, its strength grows, fed by more than just flesh.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1402001","name":"Bush Elephant","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Bush Elephant","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Massive and patient, it moves through the dense brush. The branches bend and crack as they fail to hold back the massive form of the Bush Elephant.","atk":"4","def":"5"},{"number":"1402002","name":"Enraged Prowler","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Enraged Prowler","ability":"This creature attacks a creature and destroys it: This creature may target another creature and attack again.","flavor":"Fury consumes the beast, driving it to kill again and again. Its rage knows no bounds, leaving only death in its wake.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1402003","name":"Radiant Mane Titan","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Radiant Mane Titan","ability":"At the start and end of your turn: If this is the only creature on your field, this creature gains +1 ATK and +1 DEF.","flavor":"This Titan prowls the wilds alone, its mane growing brighter with each passing moment. No one has seen its mane at full power and survived.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1502001","name":"Kong","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Kong","ability":"N/A","flavor":"This myth is real. Few dare to challenge Kong, and none can twice. They built weapons to stop him. They prayed for God to stop him. They failed.","atk":"10","def":"10"},{"number":"1502002","name":"Needleburst Wolf Pup","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Needleburst Wolf Pup","ability":"End of your turn: Double this creatures ATK and DEF.","flavor":"It starts out small, yipping and skittering through the underbrush. But if you leave it alone, even for a moment, it will grow until nothing can stop it.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"2102001","name":"Inner Strength","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Inner Strength","ability":"Target creature on your field gains +1 ATK and +1 DEF.","flavor":"In the wild, survival is the only teacher. The beast learns quickly, and its body grows to match the lesson."},{"number":"2102002","name":"Predator’s Feast","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Predator’s Feast","ability":"As an additional cost to this card: Target and destroy a creature on your field. Add the ATK and DEF of destroyed creature to a target Beast-type creature on your field.","flavor":"Nothing is wasted in the hunt. The strong devours the weak, and the strong grows stronger."},{"number":"2102003","name":"Emboldened Herd","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Emboldened Herd","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Target all creatures on your field. Give target creatures +1 ATK and +1 DEF until the end of your turn.","flavor":"One creature might hesitate, but many do not. As the herd moves together, fear fades and strength rises in its place."},{"number":"2102004","name":"Feral Instinct","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Feral Instinct","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Target creature on your field gains +2 ATK until the end of your turn.","flavor":"The moment danger is sensed, restraint vanishes. What remains is pure, sharpened aggression."},{"number":"2102005","name":"Titanic Resilience","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Titanic Resilience","ability":"AW Target creature with 10 or more DEF. It cannot be destroyed until the start of your turn.","flavor":"When strength reaches impossible heights, destruction loses meaning. The beast chuckles to itself, laughing at the world’s attempt to stop it."},{"number":"2102006","name":"Alpha Denial","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Alpha Denial","ability":"AW Negate target spell if the highest ATK creature on the field is a Beast-type creature you control with a higher ATK than target spell cost.","flavor":"The alpha’s gaze alone halts the attempt. In the hierarchy of the wild, power decides what is allowed to exist."},{"number":"2102007","name":"Primal Battle Surge","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Primal Battle Surge","ability":"AW Creature on your field is targeted for an attack: It gains +1 ATK until the battle resolves.","flavor":"The moment battle begins, instinct takes over. Strength rises through pure primal ability."},{"number":"2102008","name":"Primal Blood Rush","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Primal Blood Rush","ability":"AW Target creature on the field gains +1 ATK until the end of the current player turn.","flavor":"Thought fades into silence. Its pulse quickens, steady and deliberate, as the body prepares with perfect, primal focus."},{"number":"2102009","name":"Wild Resilience","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Wild Resilience","ability":"AW Beast-type creature on your field is targeted for an attack: It gains +2 DEF.","flavor":"The forest teaches one lesson above all: survive. When threatened, the creature becomes a wall of instinct and will."},{"number":"2202001","name":"Primal Ascension","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Primal Ascension","ability":"Target the Beast-type creature on your field with the highest ATK. Destroy all other creatures on your field. Give the targeted creature +1 ATK for each creature destroyed this way.","flavor":"Only the strongest can rise above the rest, and nature has no mercy for those who cannot."},{"number":"2202002","name":"Hidden Ferocity","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hidden Ferocity","ability":"Target creature on your field with 1 ATK or less and 1 DEF or less gains +1 ATK and +1 DEF.","flavor":"Small and easily dismissed, it carries a strength few ever notice, until it’s too late."},{"number":"2202003","name":"Hunting Surge","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hunting Surge","ability":"Beast-type creatures you play this turn gain +1 ATK and +1 DEF until the end of your next Attack Phase.","flavor":"The thrill of the hunt lingers in the air, empowering every beast that follows. None arrive unprepared for battle."},{"number":"2202004","name":"Territorial Ambush","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Territorial Ambush","ability":"AW Opponent plays a creature: Target a Beast-type creature on your field. Target creature attacks the played creature.","flavor":"This land is not open ground, it is claimed. The moment an intruder steps in, the wild answers with force."},{"number":"2202005","name":"Unleashed Fury","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Unleashed Fury","ability":"AW Beast-type creature on your field is attacked by multiple creatures: Destroy all non-Beast-type creatures in the battle.","flavor":"Surrounded, the beast answers with overwhelming violence. The wild does not defend, it eradicates."},{"number":"2202006","name":"Reward of the Hunt","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Reward of the Hunt","ability":"AW Target creature battles another creature: If target creature is not destroyed by battle and destroys the other creature, target creature gains ATK equal to the destroyed creatures ATK.","flavor":"Success sharpens the hunter. Every creature brought down feeds the strength needed for the next."},{"number":"2302001","name":"Primal Might","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Primal Might","ability":"Target creature on your field gains +2 ATK and +2 DEF.","flavor":"Its body swells with sudden strength, each motion heavier and more decisive. When the wild empowers it, nothing stands easily in its way."},{"number":"2302002","name":"Savage Presence","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Savage Presence","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Creatures on your field with 5 or more DEF cannot be the target of opponent abilities or spells for the rest of your turn.","flavor":"When a creature stands unshaken, even the enemy hesitates. Strength so great it bends the rules of engagement itself."},{"number":"2302003","name":"Savage Ambush","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Savage Ambush","ability":"AW An opponent plays a creature: Target a Beast-type creature on your field. Target creature attacks the played creature and gains +2 ATK and +1 DEF until the battle resolves.","flavor":"The moment prey steps into view, instinct erupts into violence. Strength surges as the beast launches a brutal strike."},{"number":"2402001","name":"Relentless Hunt","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Beast"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Relentless Hunt","ability":"AW Start of your turn: Pure Beast-type creatures on your field may attack a second time during the attack phase, if their first attack targeted a creature.","flavor":"The chase does not end with the first strike. Once the hunt begins, instinct refuses to let go."},{"number":"1103001","name":"Temple Acolyte","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Temple Acolyte","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Still new to the temple’s light, they follow every word, hoping one day to truly understand it.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1103002","name":"Overzealous Disciple","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Overzealous Disciple","ability":"N/A","flavor":"His devotion overtakes his caution, certain faith alone will see him through, without care of what happens to him.","atk":"2","def":"0"},{"number":"1103003","name":"Reliquary Keeper","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Reliquary Keeper","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Every relic tells a story of light; the keepers ensure those stories are never lost or defiled.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"1103004","name":"Holy Army Soldier","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Holy Army Soldier","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Chosen by the divine, they march without fear, their blade guided by unwavering conviction.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1103005","name":"Tithe Bearer","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Tithe Bearer","ability":"On play: Target opponent draws one card.","flavor":"They carry the tithe without question, trusting the light will judge its worth.","atk":"1","def":"0"},{"number":"1103006","name":"Quiet Martyr","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Quiet Martyr","ability":"This creature is destroyed by battle: Draw one card.","flavor":"He fell without good witness, but the light remembers what the world forgets.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1103007","name":"Devoted Scribe","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Devoted Scribe","ability":"During your draw for turn: Draw one additional card.","flavor":"His quill never rests, for the light’s truth must always be written.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"1103008","name":"Generous Sacrifice","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Generous Sacrifice","ability":"On play: You may exile this creature. If you do, draw three cards.","flavor":"Such a great offering is rewarded with a bright blessing, so long as one is willing to offer it.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1103009","name":"Merciful Monk Fighter","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Merciful Monk Fighter","ability":"This creature attacks: The targeted opponent or controller of the creature being attacked draws one card.","flavor":"The light teaches mercy above all, even to those who would see it extinguished without pause.","atk":"3","def":"2"},{"number":"1103010","name":"Faithful Acolyte","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Faithful Acolyte","ability":"This creature attacks a creature, destroys it, and is not destroyed by battle: Draw one card.","flavor":"His faith never falters, and in return, the light blesses his noble actions.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1103011","name":"Scripture Keeper","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Scripture Keeper","ability":"Once per turn: You may draw one card. If you do, all opponents may draw one card.","flavor":"Knowledge of the light is a gift, and he ensures no soul is left without its guidance.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1103012","name":"Holy White Knight","kind":"creature","cost":5,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Holy White Knight","ability":"N/A","flavor":"He is a part of elite warriors chosen not just for skill, but for unwavering faith and loyalty to the cause of the holy army.","atk":"4","def":"4"},{"number":"1103013","name":"Disciple of Sacrifice","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Disciple of Sacrifice","ability":"Once per turn: You may have your opponent exile a random card from your hand. If you do, draw one card.","flavor":"He gives without hesitation, for he knows that some blessings can only be received by those willing to sacrifice.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1203001","name":"Holy Army Militiaman","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Holy Army Militiaman","ability":"N/A","flavor":"He is no legend, only a militia of the light, but in the holy army, even the ordinary are called to stand.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1203002","name":"Temple Shieldbearer","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Temple Shieldbearer","ability":"N/A","flavor":"He stands tall at the gates of the temple, praying for the strength to defend it if he should need it.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1203003","name":"Witness of Light","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Witness of Light","ability":"After an opponent’s draw phase: You may draw one card. If you do, you cannot draw until the start of your turn.","flavor":"From the shadows it observes, guiding fate with unseen hands, ensuring the light reaches those who seek it.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1203004","name":"Reverent Crusader","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Reverent Crusader","ability":"This creature attacks: The targeted opponent or controller of the creature being attacked draws one card.","flavor":"Though bound to battle, he mourns every fallen foe, offering prayer and sacrifice to atone for the violence he must enact.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1203005","name":"Blessed Guard","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Blessed Guard","ability":"This creature is attacked and is not destroyed by battle: Draw one card.","flavor":"With a shield sanctified by holy rites, he stands firm, trusting that he will be rewarded for his faith.","atk":"1","def":"3"},{"number":"1203006","name":"Seraph of Blessing","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Seraph of Blessing","ability":"On play: Target opponent may draw two cards.","flavor":"It descends not to destroy, but to give, offering its enemies blessings in hopes they abandon the path of war before it is forced to act.","atk":"4","def":"4"},{"number":"1203007","name":"Blessed Statue of Fara","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Blessed Statue of Fara","ability":"This creature cannot attack. This creature is attacked: Attacking opponent may draw one card.","flavor":"Carved in the likeness of Bishop Fara, this sacred statues blessing reaches all who witness it, regardless of faith or intent.","atk":"0","def":"5"},{"number":"1203008","name":"Returning Missionary","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Returning Missionary","ability":"End of your turn: You may send this creature to your hand. If you do, draw one card.","flavor":"He walks foreign lands bearing sacred truth, returning each time ever more devoted to his purpose.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1303001","name":"Warrior Priest","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Warrior Priest","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Prayer never leaves his lips, even in battle, for it is his devotion that gives him his divine strength.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1303002","name":"Candlelit Scribe","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Candlelit Scribe","ability":"End of your turn: Draw one card.","flavor":"Through endless nights of devotion, his writings become blessings, recorded faithfully under flickering sacred flame.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1303003","name":"Champion of Faith","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Champion of Faith","ability":"You draw a card: Give this creature +1 ATK until the end of your turn.","flavor":"The blessings of the faithful are his armor, and their faith is the strength behind every blow.","atk":"1","def":"3"},{"number":"1303004","name":"Arbiter of Balance","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Arbiter of Balance","ability":"Your opponent draws one or more card: Draw one card.","flavor":"Balance must be preserved; when one side gains, so too does the holy land, as decreed by his sacred judgment.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1303005","name":"Hard Truth Scholar","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hard Truth Scholar","ability":"Once per turn: You may draw two cards. If you do, exile one of the cards drawn this way.","flavor":"He reads what others fear to touch, knowing every truth comes with a cost that cannot be ignored or undone.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1403001","name":"Empty Temple Monk","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Empty Temple Monk","ability":"This is the only creature on your field on play: Draw two cards.","flavor":"The last monk of a once-great temple continues his devotion alone, his faith echoing through empty sacred halls.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1403002","name":"Seraph of Faith","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Seraph of Faith","ability":"At all times: X and Y are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.","flavor":"Where belief is absolute, its form becomes radiant and unyielding, fed by the conviction of those who witness it.","atk":"X","def":"Y"},{"number":"1403003","name":"Archangel Orin","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Archangel Orin","ability":"This creature declares an attack: Draw two cards.","flavor":"He brings the light of the divine into the chaos of war, and the beauty of his strikes drives the holy army to overwhelming inspiration.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1503001","name":"Holy Tribunal Angel","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Holy Tribunal Angel","ability":"Once per turn: You may choose one: 1) Draw one card. 2) You and each opponent draw two cards. 3) Exile one creature on your field. If you do, exile one creature on an opponent’s field.","flavor":"It judges without hesitation, granting blessings or punishment alike, ensuring the holy land remains in divine order.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1503002","name":"Seraph of Prophecy","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Seraph of Prophecy","ability":"On play, set your hand aside. Draw five cards into a second hand. Your first hand is still considered your hand. You may play cards utilizing only the second hand as if it were your Main Phase. Your opponent cannot play cards during this time. Then, exile all remaining cards in your second hand and return to your first hand.","flavor":"The prophecy speaks of its coming, when countless blessings will fall upon the faithful and reshape the holy land.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"2103001","name":"Sacred Offering","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Sacred Offering","ability":"Exile one creature on your field. If you do, then draw one card.","flavor":"Unfortunate, yet a necessary sacrifice to earn the approval and favor of the holy one above."},{"number":"2103002","name":"Mutual Blessed Gift","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mutual Blessed Gift","ability":"All players draw two cards and reveal them. Each player then exiles one card drawn this way by the opponent on their right.","flavor":"Both are granted their coveted blessings, yet neither chooses their own, such is the balance demanded by divine fairness."},{"number":"2103003","name":"Hasty Blessing","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hasty Blessing","ability":"Draw two cards. Skip your next Draw Phase.","flavor":"Power is granted in the moment, but the future is left wanting; even divine gifts come with their due cost."},{"number":"2103004","name":"Merciful Denial","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Merciful Denial","ability":"Negate target spell. If you do, the opponent who played the spell draws cards equal to that spells cost plus 1.","flavor":"Though the act is denied, the light offers balance, rewarding what was lost through quiet mercy."},{"number":"2103005","name":"Relic of Ofikser","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Relic of Ofikser","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Target creature cannot be destroyed by battle until the end of your turn.","flavor":"A worn shard of sacred wood, bound by cord and faith. Though simple in form, its protection is unquestioned."},{"number":"2103006","name":"Spellbook Destruction","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Spellbook Destruction","ability":"AW Negate target spell. If you do, the opponent who played the spell draws cards equal to that spells cost +1.","flavor":"They burn his spellbook to ensure no malicious act against them will occur. However, they will pay him for his loss."},{"number":"2103007","name":"Faithful Balance","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Faithful Balance","ability":"AW Start of your turn: If your hand has fewer cards than target opponent’s hand, draw cards until you have the same number of cards as target opponent and skip your Draw Phase.","flavor":"The scales of fate are never left uneven, for the divine ensures all things are brought back into balance."},{"number":"2103008","name":"Cost of Illumination","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Cost of Illumination","ability":"AW Your opponent draws a card: They must either exile that card or exile one creature on their field.","flavor":"To receive the light is to accept its burden, for every truth revealed demands faithful devotion."},{"number":"2103009","name":"Merciful Execution","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Merciful Execution","ability":"AW Opponent plays a creature: Exile that creature. The opponent who played the creature draws cards equal to that creature’s cost +2.","flavor":"A life must be taken, but the light ensures compensation follows, softening the cruelty of necessary judgment."},{"number":"2203001","name":"Merciful Exile","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Merciful Exile","ability":"Exile one creature on your opponent’s field. The opponent who controlled the creature draws cards equal to that creature’s cost +1.","flavor":"Judgment demands exile, yet mercy lingers in its wake, granting the condemned a path beyond the light they left."},{"number":"2203002","name":"Enlightened Strength","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Enlightened Strength","ability":"Target creature gains +1 ATK for each card you draw this turn.","flavor":"To understand is to be strengthened. Every revealed truth becomes a foundation upon which greater power is built."},{"number":"2203003","name":"Answered Prayer","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Answered Prayer","ability":"Draw one card.","flavor":"The simplest of prayers are often the ones answered."},{"number":"2203004","name":"Unshaken Faith","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Unshaken Faith","ability":"AW Opponent plays a card that negates one of your spells: Negate that spell. Both you and the opponent who played the spell draw one card.","flavor":"Temptation breaks against unwavering belief, and in resisting the pull, the faith is rewarded."},{"number":"2203005","name":"The Martyrs\u0027 Blessing","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"The Martyrs\u0027 Blessing","ability":"AW Creature on your field is attacked: draw one card for each attacking creature.","flavor":"Every wound becomes a testament, and every trial a seed, those who suffer for faith are equally repaid."},{"number":"2203006","name":"Prayer Before Battle","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Prayer Before Battle","ability":"Give every creature on your field that has not attacked this turn +1 DEF.","flavor":"For a brief moment, the battlefield falls silent as the soldiers pray for protection before marching back into war."},{"number":"2303001","name":"Selective Blessing","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Selective Blessing","ability":"Draw three cards. Exile all creatures drawn this way.","flavor":"The light reveals all things without mercy, only what is deemed worthy remains, the rest fade into holy oblivion."},{"number":"2303002","name":"Blessing of Opposition","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Blessing of Opposition","ability":"Draw one card for each creature on target opponent’s field. Then end your turn.","flavor":"Every presence is seen, every soul accounted for. The more that stand against you, the more the light blesses you with."},{"number":"2303003","name":"Costly Preservation","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Costly Preservation","ability":"AW Creature you control would be destroyed by battle: Instead draw cards until you draw a creature card, then draw two more. Exile all cards drawn this way.","flavor":"Death is denied its claim by holy decision, but the cost is steep to laugh in the face of death. A sacrifice is more than necessary."},{"number":"2403001","name":"Holy War Rapture","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Light"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Holy War Rapture","ability":"Exile all creatures on the field. Each player draws cards equal to the number of creatures they controlled that were exiled this way.","flavor":"Divine Judgment descends, all forms are judged equally, and equally found wanting. Perhaps new blessings will right these wrongs."},{"number":"1104001","name":"Shadow Initiate","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Shadow Initiate","ability":"N/A","flavor":"They step into shadow willingly, leaving behind name and past, embracing the quiet pull of something far more sinister.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1104002","name":"Crazed Cultist","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Crazed Cultist","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Eyes wide and unfocused, he lunges without thought, his blade guided by whispers only he can still hear.","atk":"2","def":"0"},{"number":"1104003","name":"Hollow Sentinel","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Hollow Sentinel","ability":"N/A","flavor":"No body fills the armor, yet it moves slowly and awkwardly. Something must be possessing it.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"1104004","name":"Back Road Brigand","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Back Road Brigand","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Travelers whisper of a lone brigand on the back roads, his bloodied axe striking before crys can ever reach helpful ears.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1104005","name":"Unstable Aberration","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Unstable Aberration","ability":"Battle involving this creature resolves: Discard a card, then target this creature and destroy it.","flavor":"A failed fusion of flesh and void, it lashes out with each motion, its unstable body bleeding corruption into the world.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1104006","name":"Spiteful Spirit","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Spiteful Spirit","ability":"This creature is destroyed by battle: Opponent that destroyed it discards a card if they have two or more in hand.","flavor":"Weak in form but rich in malice, it clings to existence just long enough to curse whoever dares to strike it down.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1104007","name":"Vengeful Hunter","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Vengeful Hunter","ability":"This creature destroys another creature by battle: Controller of that creature discards a card if they have two or more cards in hand.","flavor":"It hunts not for survival, but for vengeance, marking each fallen prey with a curse that lingers long after death.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1104008","name":"Black Fountain","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Fountain","ability":"This creature cannot attack. Start of your turn: All opponents discard one card.","flavor":"The fountain bubbles with a thick black liquid, used by cultists in rituals to spread curses.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1104009","name":"Dark Pact Vessel","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Dark Pact Vessel","ability":"End of your turn: You may discard a card from your hand. If you do target and destroy this creature, then play \"Mind Rotting Wraith\" from your hand for free.","flavor":"The ritual demands more than blood; it demands devotion, and this vessel is more than willing to be consumed.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1104010","name":"Cursed Bait","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Cursed Bait","ability":"This creature is attacked and destroyed by battle: Attacking opponent must discard a card.","flavor":"\"Go on… strike it down…” the cultists whisper, knowing the true trap is not the body, but the curse it leaves behind.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1104011","name":"Sorrow Drinker","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Sorrow Drinker","ability":"You discard a card: This creature gains +1 DEF.","flavor":"Small and unimposing, it lingers at the edges of suffering, feeding on grief and loss until it grows just strong enough.","atk":"1","def":"0"},{"number":"1104012","name":"Golden Imp Of Greed","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Golden Imp Of Greed","ability":"While an opponent has 5+ cards in their hand: This creature cannot be targeted by them.","flavor":"It whispers of wealth and excess, pushing mortals to hoard and covet, feeding on the imbalance their greed creates.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1104013","name":"Death Clinger","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Death Clinger","ability":"While you have one card in your hand: This creature has 1 DEF.","flavor":"It lingers where life falters, clinging close to the dying, growing faintly stronger as the final breath draws near.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1204001","name":"Cutthroat Cultist","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Cutthroat Cultist","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Years in the shadows have honed his craft; his curved blade strikes fast, ending lives before prayers can be spoken.","atk":"2","def":"1"},{"number":"1204002","name":"Pink Imp","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Pink Imp","ability":"N/A","flavor":"Its size betrays it; though small, its rage burns hot, carving chaos where it can into a world not meant to hold it.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1204003","name":"Repressed Devil","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Repressed Devil","ability":"On play: Discard a card for every creature on your field.","flavor":"Denied the indulgence it craves, its hunger festers inward, twisting into a curse that turns onto the devil.","atk":"3","def":"1"},{"number":"1204004","name":"Dark Executioner","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Dark Executioner","ability":"Once per turn: You may discard three cards. If you do, target and destroy one creature on the field.","flavor":"Justice holds no meaning to him, only the promise of payment. Every life taken is simply another completed task.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1204005","name":"Curse Eater Spirit","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Curse Eater Spirit","ability":"An opponent discards a card: This creature gains +1 ATK until the end of that opponents turn.","flavor":"It feeds on hexes and misfortune alike, each curse swallowed only makes its hunger grow deeper.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1204006","name":"Mindlash Moroi","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mindlash Moroi","ability":"Start of your turn: If an opponent has more than three cards in their hand, they must discard one card.","flavor":"Paranoia given form, it curses what it fears most: intentions not yet spoken aloud. It can feel the thoughts of those near it.","atk":"2","def":"3"},{"number":"1204007","name":"Flesh Tithed Cultist","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Flesh Tithed Cultist","ability":"This creature is attacked: You may discard X cards. If you do, give this creature X ATK until the battle resolves.","flavor":"It carves devotion into flesh, willingly binding itself to suffering for power that only ever fades.","atk":"3","def":"1"},{"number":"1204008","name":"Starved Dark Soul","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Starved Dark Soul","ability":"Start of your turn: Target opponent must discard a card.","flavor":"This weakened soul wanders endlessly, consuming whatever energy it can find from those unlucky enough to cross its path.","atk":"0","def":"0"},{"number":"1304001","name":"Red Imp","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Red Imp","ability":"N/A","flavor":"A constant nuisance of the underworld, it delights in small evils, knowing they always grow into something worse.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1304002","name":"Abyss Tax Collector","kind":"creature","cost":3,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Abyss Tax Collector","ability":"An opponent plays a card: That opponent must discard a card.","flavor":"A dark creature of the Abyss, it marks down even the smallest deeds. it ensures that the debt due to it is paid in suffering, not coin.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1304003","name":"Cheating Grey Imp","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Cheating Grey Imp","ability":"You discard this card for any reason other than paying a card cost: You may send this card to your field instead of the discard pile.","flavor":"It wedges itself unwanted into every deal, twisting outcomes just enough to ensure it comes out ahead.","atk":"2","def":"0"},{"number":"1304004","name":"Mind Rotting Wraith","kind":"creature","cost":4,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mind Rotting Wraith","ability":"Start of an opponent\u0027s turn: That opponent must discard a card.","flavor":"It slips its dark will into living minds, eroding thought until nothing remains but gradual decay.","atk":"2","def":"2"},{"number":"1304005","name":"Black Venom Viper","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Black Venom Viper","ability":"This creature battles another creature: Destroy the other creature at the end of the turn.","flavor":"Small and vile, it thrives by turning pain into nourishment, never leaving a clean wound behind.","atk":"1","def":"1"},{"number":"1404001","name":"Abyss Sucker","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Abyss Sucker","ability":"Start of a players turn: The active player must discard down to two cards.","flavor":"A spirit that does not fight directly, it feeds on the unguarded soul of those who never saw it coming.","atk":"0","def":"1"},{"number":"1404002","name":"Jealous Green Devil","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Jealous Green Devil","ability":"An opponent has more cards in their hand than you: This creature may target that opponent\u0027s hand directly when attacking. This creature cannot attack during the Attack Phase, but may attack at the end of your Draw Phase.","flavor":"A weak Devil that cannot stand to be lesser; the moment it sees abundance, it lashes out to tear others down to its level.","atk":"1","def":"2"},{"number":"1404003","name":"Unleashed Devil","kind":"creature","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Unleashed Devil","ability":"Start of your Attack Phase: This creature must attack a creature on the field.","flavor":"Freed from all bindings, it tears through everything in sight, unable and unwilling to restrain its violent nature.","atk":"5","def":"3"},{"number":"1504001","name":"Full Carnage Devil","kind":"creature","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Full Carnage Devil","ability":"This creature may attack up to five times each Attack Phase. This creature declares an attack: Discard X cards, where X is one plus the number of times this creature has previously attacked this turn.","flavor":"Nothing satisfies its endless thirst for death; each kill only deepens the hunger that drives it forward.","atk":"5","def":"3"},{"number":"1504002","name":"Echo, Opportune Devil","kind":"creature","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Legendary","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Echo, Opportune Devil","ability":"Battle involving this creature resolves: Destroy all other creatures involved in the battle. Card is discarded from an opponent\u0027s hand for any reason other than paying a card cost: This creature may declare an attack.","flavor":"It waits for the perfect moment, striking the instant weakness appears, ensuring every chance ends in death.","atk":"0","def":"2"},{"number":"2104001","name":"Equal Suffering","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Equal Suffering","ability":"All players have two or more cards in their hand: All players target a random card from the opponent on their right\u0027s hand. Discard all targeted cards.","flavor":"While the dark ones love causing suffering, in order to fully understand the pain they are causing they must also endure it."},{"number":"2104002","name":"Gluttony’s Toll","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Gluttony’s Toll","ability":"Target opponent has more than seven cards in their hand: Target opponent must discard to a hand size of five.","flavor":"Excess invites corruption, and when abundance grows too great, something darker comes to collect."},{"number":"2104003","name":"Living Debt Collection","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Living Debt Collection","ability":"Destroy target creature on the field unless opponent discards equal to target creatures cost.","flavor":"Payment is inevitable; if coin fails, life itself is claimed to settle what is owed."},{"number":"2104004","name":"Costly Confession","kind":"spell","cost":4,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Costly Confession","ability":"Target opponent must discard a card.","flavor":"Truth is forced into the open through pain, each word dragged out at a terrible price."},{"number":"2104005","name":"Desperation Surge","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Desperation Surge","ability":"AW You can only play this card if you have three cards in your hand. During your Attack Phase: Give a creature on your field +2 ATK and +1 DEF until the end of your turn.","flavor":"At the edge of ruin, true strength emerges, drawn not from hope, but from necessity."},{"number":"2104006","name":"Overfilled Cup","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Overfilled Cup","ability":"AW An opponent plays a spell and has four or more cards in hand: Negate target spell.","flavor":"A vessel filled past reason invites ruin; it takes only a moment for the excess to spill into a chaotic mess."},{"number":"2104007","name":"Whispered Suggestion","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Whispered Suggestion","ability":"AW One of multiple creatures on your field is attacked by an opponent: That opponent must discard a card or target a different creature on your field.","flavor":"A quiet voice coils through the mind, urging a different path, though whether it helps or harms is never clear."},{"number":"2104008","name":"Greedy Tear","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Greedy Tear","ability":"AW An opponent draws three or more cards at one time: That opponent must discard all cards drawn at that time.","flavor":"Gold piles high until the seams split, and in an instant, the hoarded wealth scatters beyond reach."},{"number":"2104009","name":"Power Deflection","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Common","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Power Deflection","ability":"AW One of multiple creatures on your field is attacked: Discard a card for each attacking creature. If you do, change the target of the attack to another creature on your field.","flavor":"Even the mightiest blow can falter when met with precise resistance at the perfect moment."},{"number":"2204001","name":"Costly Assassination","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Costly Assassination","ability":"Target creature on the field. Discard equal to the ATK plus DEF of target creature. If you do, destroy target creature. This spell cannot be negated.","flavor":"The cleanest kill requires the most skilled of assassins, which requires the highest of prices."},{"number":"2204002","name":"Army Tax","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Army Tax","ability":"Each player must discard a card for every creature on their field, or discard to a hand size of two.","flavor":"Every soldier adds weight to the burden; the larger the force, the greater the inevitable cost to keep them."},{"number":"2204003","name":"Dark Amplification","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Dark Amplification","ability":"AW During your Attack Phase: Discard X cards and give a creature on your field +X ATK and +X DEF until the end of your turn.","flavor":"Shadows coil around it, feeding its strength with borrowed power that is needed in the moment, but it will fade as quickly as it came."},{"number":"2204004","name":"Toll of Entry","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Toll of Entry","ability":"AW An opponent plays a creature: That opponent must discard a card or return the creature to hand.","flavor":"“The price has risen. Pay it, or turn back. There are no other paths forward.” - Bron Toll Agent"},{"number":"2204005","name":"Opening Ruin","kind":"spell","cost":2,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Opening Ruin","ability":"AW End of an opponent\u0027s Draw Phase: That opponent must discard two cards.","flavor":"A disastrous beginning sets the tone, unraveling any plans before they can even begin."},{"number":"2204006","name":"Additional Tax","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Uncommon","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Additional Tax","ability":"During target opponent\u0027s next turn: All cards cost one more to play.","flavor":"Another burden falls upon the masses, tightening control until even survival demands more than they can give."},{"number":"2304001","name":"Cataclysmic Offering","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Cataclysmic Offering","ability":"You can only play this card if you have not played a card this turn. Discard a card for every creature on target opponent\u0027s field. If you do, target and destroy all creatures on target opponent\u0027s field. Then end your turn.","flavor":"Such a grand offering calls forth devastation, as the dark one repays tribute with overwhelming destruction."},{"number":"2304002","name":"Mirror of Twisted Fate","kind":"spell","cost":1,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mirror of Twisted Fate","ability":"AW You are Direct Attacked by an opponent: That opponent becomes the target of the Direct Attack. Opponent does not discard their last card due to the Direct Attack.","flavor":"The grotesque mirror grins as fate bends against you. Within its warped surface, your fate cruelly twists against you."},{"number":"2304003","name":"Dark Absorption","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Rare","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Dark Absorption","ability":"AW Opponent plays a spell targeting a creature on your field: Discard equal to that spells cost. If you do, negate that spell.","flavor":"The darkness coils like a living thing, moving forward to swallow the spell whole before it can reach its target."},{"number":"2404001","name":"Mutual Ruin","kind":"spell","cost":0,"types":["Dark"],"rarity":"Epic","color":"green","symbol":"âœ¦","image":"Mutual Ruin","ability":"All players discard a card.","flavor":"When nothing remains to lose, restraint fades, and even the broken lash out with nothing left to fear or protect."}];
